---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-05-23';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Vihren Labs LTD handles your personal information — newsletter signups, contact emails, and analytics."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-white/85">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="line-number text-orange uppercase">/privacy</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mt-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-white/50 mt-3">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-content space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Vihren Labs LTD ("Vihren Labs", "we", "us") is the controller for any personal
        information collected through <a href="https://vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">vihrenlabs.com</a>.
        This page explains what we collect, why, who we share it with, how long we keep it,
        and the rights you have under the GDPR.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Vihren Labs LTD is a Bulgarian limited company (EOOD) registered in Sofia,
        Bulgaria. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hello@vihrenlabs.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">2. What we collect, and why</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Newsletter signups (email address only).</strong> Stored in our
          newsletter provider (Beehiiv, or Resend Audiences as a backup). Used to send
          the operator-brand newsletter and occasional product announcements. You can
          unsubscribe with one click from any email — that's GDPR Article 7(3) revocation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Direct emails to us.</strong> When you email
          <a href="mailto:hello@vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hello@vihrenlabs.com</a>,
          we keep your message and email address to reply. We don't add you to the
          newsletter from this unless you ask.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Basic analytics.</strong> Vercel (our hosting provider) records aggregate,
          IP-anonymised pageview counts to keep the site up. We don't run Google Analytics,
          Meta Pixel, or other third-party trackers. If Pinterest claims this site, Pinterest
          may record click-through events to its own platform per Pinterest's privacy terms.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">3. Third parties we share data with</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Beehiiv</strong> (newsletter delivery) — your email address only.
          <a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/privacy" class="text-orange hover:underline">Beehiiv privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Resend</strong> (transactional email + audience storage) — your email address only.
          <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-orange hover:underline">Resend privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Vercel</strong> (hosting + minimal aggregate analytics).
          <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-orange hover:underline">Vercel privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Pinterest</strong> (when the site is claimed by our Pinterest business account, Pinterest tracks
          referral traffic).
          <a href="https://policy.pinterest.com/en/privacy-policy" class="text-orange hover:underline">Pinterest privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Gumroad</strong> (when you buy a product through our shop links, Gumroad — not us — is
          the data controller for that transaction).
          <a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy" class="text-orange hover:underline">Gumroad privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Etsy</strong> (when you buy a product through our Etsy shop links, Etsy — not us — is
          the data controller).
          <a href="https://www.etsy.com/legal/privacy/" class="text-orange hover:underline">Etsy privacy policy</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade personal data. We do not use it for advertising profiles or AI training.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">4. How long we keep things</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Newsletter email addresses: until you unsubscribe, then deleted within 30 days.</li>
        <li>Direct emails to us: as long as needed to handle the conversation + 12 months for support history.</li>
        <li>Analytics: aggregated only; no per-visitor record beyond 30 days.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">5. Your GDPR rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the EU General Data Protection Regulation, you can ask us to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Confirm whether we hold data about you, and give you a copy (Article 15).</li>
        <li>Correct anything inaccurate (Article 16).</li>
        <li>Delete your data (Article 17). The "unsubscribe" link in every newsletter does this for the email list.</li>
        <li>Restrict or object to processing (Articles 18 + 21).</li>
        <li>Receive your data in a portable format (Article 20).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:hello@vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hello@vihrenlabs.com</a> for
        any of the above and we'll respond within 30 days. You can also complain to the Bulgarian
        data-protection regulator (<a href="https://www.cpdp.bg/en/" class="text-orange hover:underline">CPDP</a>) if
        you're not satisfied with how we've handled a request.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">6. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no marketing or analytics cookies of its own. Embedded third-party services
        (Beehiiv signup form, Pinterest pin embeds if added later) may set cookies governed by their
        own privacy policies linked above.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">7. Children</h2>
      <p>
        vihrenlabs.com is not directed at children under 16. We don't knowingly collect data from anyone
        in that age group. If you believe we have, email us and we'll delete it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this page when we add new tools or change how we use data. Material changes
        will be announced in the newsletter. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the most
        recent revision.
      </p>

      <p class="pt-8 text-white/50 text-sm border-t border-white/10 mt-12">
        This policy is plain-English and intentionally short. If a clause needs more detail for a
        compliance question (DPO appointment, sub-processor list, etc.), email us and we'll
        respond in writing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-content a { word-break: break-word; }
  .prose-content h2 { letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
</style>
